    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\cos3\\theta=4\\cos^3\\theta-3\\cos\\theta$.\n\nExpand $\\cos(2\\theta+\\theta)$ and substitute the double-angle identities.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos3\\theta&=\\cos(2\\theta+\\theta)\\\\\\cos3\\theta&=\\cos2\\theta\\cos\\theta-\\sin2\\theta\\sin\\theta\\\\\\cos3\\theta&=(2\\cos^2\\theta-1)\\cos\\theta-2\\sin^2\\theta\\cos\\theta\\\\\\cos3\\theta&=2\\cos^3\\theta-\\cos\\theta-2(1-\\cos^2\\theta)\\cos\\theta\\\\\\cos3\\theta&=4\\cos^3\\theta-3\\cos\\theta\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 44
